::MCR_U04_L04_Quiz_Q01::
Question ID: MCR_U04_L04_Quiz_Q01
MLA Standard: MLA.MCR.FL.7
Question:
Which response best supports this credit, loan, and debt skill: calculate total paid from monthly payments?
{
=A. Compare total cost, payment amount, interest, term, and budget constraints.#Correct. Credit and debt decisions require both short-term and long-term cost reasoning.
~B. Choose the lowest monthly payment without checking total paid.#A lower payment can cost more over a longer term. 
~C. Ignore interest and fees.#Interest and fees are part of the cost of borrowing. 
~D. Treat credit approval as affordability.#Approval does not mean the debt fits the budget or is the best choice.
}
